WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.930
An intermingling of repeated wishes...

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:08.140
Two destinies intertwining...

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:13.500
Long, long ago, in the 
land of the rising sun,

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.570
the gods held a festival to 
choose twelve divine messengers

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.440
to protect the newborn land.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.760
However, due to the Rat's trickery,

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.460
the Cat was not able to 
participate in the festival

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.000
and could not become part of the zodiac.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.830
This is a story that still continues today,

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:38.130
of a pure-hearted cat and 
the twelve "Eto-musume."

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:01.870
<b>ETOTAMA</b>

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:26.000
<b>Episode 1: The Exuberant Cat Girl</b>

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.180
Okay...

00:02:57.430 --> 00:02:58.530
Here we go!

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:00.680
Let's go!

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:01.660
Off we go.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.760
Let's hurry.

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:03.220
Come on, quickly.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:04.900
If you please.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.280
Yay! Yay!

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.280
C'mon, pull!

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:06.790
Go.

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:09.810
You're so heavy, it won't move!

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:12.120
And?

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:12.540
<b>Ox</b>

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:12.920
<b>Tiger</b>

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:13.250
<b>Rabbit</b>

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:13.630
<b>Snake</b>

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:14.040
<b>Horse</b>

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:14.400
<b>Sheep</b>

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:14.770
<b>Monkey</b>

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:15.130
<b>Rooster</b>

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:15.500
<b>Dog</b>

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:18.330
What do you want with me?

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.840
We're conducting a street survey!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:23.300
Please list the Chinese zodiac in order.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.480
Chinese zodiac?

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.260
<b>Hiruichi</b>

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.260
<b>Q. List the Chinese zodiac in order</b>

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.260
Um...

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:29.190
Hear that? He said "Eto."

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:30.750
'Cause that "um" noise sounds like "Eto!"

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.210
That was pretty bad.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.560
It wasn't on purpose.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:36.790
Don't worry about that. 
Just list the Chinese zodiac.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:41.240
Rat, ox, tiger, rabbit, dragon, snake...

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.660
Snake, snake... What was after that?

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:45.910
I knew it!

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:45.910
<b>Rabbit: Winner</b>

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.880
It's lookin' good for us.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:48.450
<b>Tiger: Winner</b>

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:48.450
What is?

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.430
Oh, yes!

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:51.660
<b>Ox: Winner</b>

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:51.660
"Yes"?

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:57.290
<b>Snake: Winner</b>

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:53.760
Not again...

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.090
Why?!

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.270
Um, hello?

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:57.290
<b>Losers</b>

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:56.270
This  hurts...

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:57.340
It stopped at me again...

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:01.920
<b>Winners</b>

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.920
Okay, I'm going now.

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:07.450
<b>House For Rent</b>

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:07.450
<b>-Single house with yard 
-Rent: 30,000 per month 
-Lots of sunlight 
-Faces south -Two stories 
-Comes with furniture -Just one imperfection</b>

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:07.450
<i>A single house with a yard 
for 30,000 yen per month...</i>

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.430
<i>It looks normal from the outside,</i>

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:16.810
<i>but what's this "Just one imperfection: 
part of the living room is </i>fukafuka<i>"?</i>

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.650
<b>Part of the living room is <i>fukafuka</i></b>

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.910
<i>That's the </i>fukafuka<i> part?</i>

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:27.750
Wow, it really is puffy (fukafuka).

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.290
What is this hole?!

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.660
It's deep (fuka)! That's a deep hole!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:35.810
Wait, that's not what it 
meant by <i>fukafuka</i>, is it?

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:37.840
I need to calm down.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:44.580
I guess it shouldn't be a 
problem if I'm careful.

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:47.850
Huh? That meow...

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.120
Meow~

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:50.140
From there?

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.160
Meow~

00:04:58.610 --> 00:04:59.830
Meow.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:03.860
Did that excite you?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:07.160
I'm Amato Takeru. Who are you?

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:16.980
I'm Nya-tan, meow!

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.090
Nya-tan Meow-san?

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.090
No! I'm Nya-tan, meow!

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.590
Noim Nya-tan Meow-san?

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.040
What language is that?!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:26.840
I'm Nya-tan! Meow!

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:29.090
Oh, okay. Nya-tan, then.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:32.350
Why are you tired of it 
now?! Wait a second!

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:36.100
Did that lick excite you?

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.820
Yeah. It did.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:45.000
Be honest! I want to hear 
the truth, not a lie.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:46.110
Fidget

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.480
Even if it hurts...

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:47.610
Sorry. I lied.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.610
That hurt!

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:49.800
Why?!

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:53.870
How are you not excited after a run-in 
with a lucky licking situation like that?!

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:54.640
Hmm...

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:56.910
I see... So this is a lucky situation, huh?

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:57.830
Seriously?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.530
I don't really get it, but sorry 
I didn't meet your expectations.

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:01.380
Depressing!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:03.530
I'm not enough for you?

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.880
No, that's not what I meant...

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:07.930
I guess it's neither good nor bad.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:08.630
Depressing!

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:11.310
Meow!

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:14.310
You know, if you're leaving, 
you should use the front door...

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.730
This is a survey!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.070
Wh-What?

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:21.990
List the Chinese zodiac in order!

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:22.690
Huh?

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:23.770
Just do it.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.230
Um...

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:28.610
Rat, ox, tiger, rabbit, dragon, snake...

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.280
Snake... Snake...

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:36.290
<b>Losers</b>

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:35.830
It's the sound of it! 
"Horse" just doesn't roll off the tongue!

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:35.830
Can I go now?

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:46.090
Well, it's a little early, 
but I guess I'll take a bath.

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:49.620
Meow?

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:54.260
Meow! Onii-chan, you pervert!

00:06:56.170 --> 00:07:00.320
Onii-chan, were you hoping 
to take a bath with me?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:01.770
B-But...

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:04.400
I'd be embarrassed, though...

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:07.110
To bathe with you...

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:10.400
I'm thinking of taking you to the police 
for unlawful entry and assault.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:13.950
<b>Rumble</b>

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.790
You mean civil or criminal?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.950
If you want, I can appeal for both.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:21.940
It's hopeless.

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:25.970
Nobody remembers us at all.

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:28.550
Honestly, you all look pathetic.

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.300
Shut up!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.870
Don't get so upset.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:35.500
We'll just have to come 
up with a way to list the

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.540
Chinese zodiac that's easier to remember.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.560
Oh! That's a good, nice idea!

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:42.560
What sort of way?

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:43.810
Chinese.

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:49.940
Oh, Chinese, huh? That would be...

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:55.220
Zi, chou, yin, mao, chen, si, 
wu, wei, shen, you, xu, hai.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.230
That's pretty rhythmic!

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:57.950
I like it!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:58.580
Right?

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:02.790
Zi, chou, yin, mao, chen, 
si, wu, wei, shen, you, xu,

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:03.290
hai!

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:03.790
Wu!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:04.190
Wei!

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:04.430
Shen!

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:04.760
You!

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:05.100
Xu!

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:05.790
Hai!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.970
Wu, wei, shen, you, xu, hai!

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:10.250
You, xu, hai! You, xu, hai!

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.550
Hai! Hai!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:12.860
Hai! Hai! Hai! Hai!

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.180
Hai! Hai!

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.510
Hai! Hai! Hai! Hai!

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:24.730
Oh, Takeru-han! Do you feel better?

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:29.730
Here. It's just something simple I 
whipped up from what was in the fridge.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:29.730
<b>Milk</b>

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:35.560
<i>How's this?! I'm a Kyoto woman who can 
put together a snack from leftovers!</i>

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:38.030
<i>This character is also 
divorced with one child!</i>

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:39.750
I'm going out for a bit.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.510
Where are you going?

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:43.040
To buy food...

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.160
and scout around.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.540
Thank you very much.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:52.100
A delivery?

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.260
Meow!

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:01.930
Sorry it took so long! 
I finally made up my mind!

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.140
Your present is...

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.060
Me!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:05.920
That's my character now!

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.110
Add indecent exposure to the charges.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:11.440
Don't sharpen your claws on the pillar.

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:14.400
So what is it you want to do, exactly?

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:16.580
I can't...

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.090
I can't settle on a character type.

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:20.300
Meowie? Meowow?

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:21.720
Mea? Mew?

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:22.410
Meoo?

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.080
So you're trying to find yourself?

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:28.710
When you put it that way, 
it sounds really embarrassing.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:30.670
Fidget

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.670
I wish I could jump into a hole!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:31.320
Here.

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:32.300
<b>Hole</b>

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.300
Seriously?!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:39.130
You really did go in.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:42.100
That's what you get for dressing like that.

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.810
But, but...

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:48.600
<b>Bath Automatic</b>

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:48.600
<b>More Hot Water</b>

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.610
The bath won't take long to fill.

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:55.920
They say if your body is cold, 
your heart will stay cold, too.

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:58.340
I heard that from someone a long time ago.

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:09.880
Huh? Something smells nice...

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.670
I'm all warmed up!

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:19.850
Takeru, get me a beer!

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:20.390
Huh?!

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.140
How old are you?

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:24.180
I'm a divine messenger.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:26.890
I'm not human, so age means nothing to me.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:29.000
I have no idea what you're talking about,

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.240
and I'm a minor, so I have no beer.

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:32.690
Aww... Okay, black vinegar!

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:33.340
I don't have that, either.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:34.240
Then olive oil!

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:35.380
I don't— Wait, you drink that?

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.400
Then sesame oil.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.150
None of that, either.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:38.650
Wh-Who was that?!

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:42.910
Pleased to meet you. I'm Uri-tan.

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:44.540
Uri-tan?

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:48.290
Yes. I'm an Eto-musume, like Nya-tan.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.280
Eto-musume?

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:50.920
Yes.

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:55.070
Oh, but I'm ranked higher than Nya-tan.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:57.920
<b>Zodiac Girl</b>

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:57.070
I'm the boar, Eto-shin.

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:57.920
<b>Boar</b>

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:57.920
<b>Zodiac God</b>

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:57.920
Right.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.930
So I might as well ask... 
Where'd you come from?

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.420
From this hole.

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:03.430
<b>Hole</b>

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.430
I should've known...

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:05.970
Where does that hole lead to?

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:07.120
The world of the gods.

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:07.870
Gods?!

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:08.630
Sometimes.

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:09.940
What do you mean, sometimes?

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:15.060
By the way, is Nya-tan working hard at 
her training to join the Chinese zodiac?

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:19.950
Are you trying to speed up the story?

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:19.950
ack

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:22.280
This feels like a exposition 
character just showed up

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.120
because Nya-tan was dragging things out.

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:29.730
Well, the A part is going to be over soon...

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:30.460
A part?

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:32.830
You really haven't been told anything?!

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.590
Nya-tan, what have you 
been doing all this time?

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:39.880
What?

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:43.230
And?

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:46.630
Okay... I'm a cat Eto-musume,

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.970
and I really want to become 
part of the Chinese zodiac.

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.160
A cat in the Chinese zodiac?

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:52.190
Yes.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.310
Why?

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:58.270
Come to think of it, I'm not really sur—

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:00.240
Well, you see, that's...

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:06.240
What was that?

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:10.920
I've been looking for you,

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:13.090
Nya-tan.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:20.010
<b>[Eto-musume]   Animals possessing "Etotama," the spirits of the Chinese zodiac, who can transform into even purer maiden forms via Sol/Lull. The highest Eto-musume are called Eto-shin, and the rest are simply called Eto-musume.</b>

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:25.010
<b>[Moe Power (Sol/Lull)]  A power given from gods to people, and from people to Eto-musume. It is also what gives the Eto-musume their life force through the "proper emotions" of humans, such as joy and gratitude, and is the energy that comprises all things in nature.</b>

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.770
D-Dora-tan?

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.330
A dragon aura... The dragon Eto-musume?

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:46.280
Yes. More specifically, she's an Eto-shin.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.480
So if she's a god, Nya-tan, 
she's higher than y—

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:49.240
Why are you here?!

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.290
You shouldn't have to ask why.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.430
I can't believe it!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:55.410
Is she shocked because this dragon girl

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:58.040
she thought was a friend 
ended up being a traitor?

00:12:58.410 --> 00:12:59.220
Why?

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.310
A human...

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.220
Look out!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:11.470
Takeru!

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.780
What is this about?

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:32.400
I'll come at you for real 
this time, Nya-tan.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:33.870
<b>Dragon</b>

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:33.870
Prepare yourself.

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:34.870
Oh no!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:35.900
Takeru!

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:36.620
Huh? What?

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.380
Give me Sol/Lull!

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.600
Huh? Sol/Lull?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.130
What is that? I've never 
heard that word before.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.800
There's no time to explain!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.840
You know! The stuff you 
sparkled out in the A part!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:49.730
Uh-huh...

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:51.540
Come on! Cough it up!

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.740
You just have to squeeze some out!

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:55.850
Yeah, but what <i>is</i> Sol/Lull?

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:59.770
It is a sacred power given from gods to 
people, and from people to Eto-musume.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:14:01.860
<b>Sol/Lull (Moe Power) Is:</b>

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.860
Human emotions such as joy and gratitude—

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.070
Takeru! Takeru!

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:08.070
You were out of body soap 
earlier, so I refilled it!

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.610
Oh, really? Well...

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:12.260
<b>Thank You</b>

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:10.890
Thank you.

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:24.200
Takeru, this is enough Sol/Lull for now!

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:24.810
Huh?

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.970
Etotama! Sol/Lull Charge!

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:28.990
<b>Cat</b>

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:30.470
<b>Cat</b>

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.900
Cat Eto-musume, Nya-tan!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:09.100
<i>Get ready for the match.</i>

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:35.640
Um, they're both a lot 
smaller all of a sudden.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.680
This is ETM12.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:38.130
Huh?

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:41.240
Oh, but this is not an official match...

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:45.030
It wasn't Nya-tan who proposed 
the battle, so in this case...

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:47.530
Oh, I'll explain it to 
you properly next time.

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:50.160
S-Seriously? You're allowed 
to drag it out like that?

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:51.560
For starters, let's see what happens.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.390
Why did you betray me?!

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:59.140
You wouldn't understand.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.710
I trusted you...

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.150
Why?!

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.850
You wouldn't understand even if I told you!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.270
Was it all...

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:49.150
Was it all a lie?

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:51.780
The smiles...

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:53.370
The tears...

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:55.110
That promise...

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:58.030
And the future we were 
reaching for together?!

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:07.670
That's right.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:14.840
Is this all there is to the power 
of the soul in your fist?!

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:18.720
You're weak!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.720
You're too weak, Nya-tan!

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:25.730
I think it's time I ended this.

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:56.510
Come, Ryuusen Bashou!

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:02.060
This is the end!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:14.230
Looks like you're out of Sol/Lull.

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:18.450
I-I'm not done yet!

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:23.910
The idea of you becoming an Eto-shin

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:26.950
is laughable!

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:32.590
It disappeared...

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.620
The battle is over.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:35.880
Battle terminated.

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:42.350
She's really bawling.

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:45.540
I lost!

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.890
Stop crying. You're embarrassing yourself.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:51.930
I'm not sure what's going on, 
but don't worry about it, Nya-tan.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:55.100
Your kindness hurts!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.100
That's...

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:58.610
Goodness... That's some first-rate Sol/Lull.

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:01.110
What do you mean, first-rate?

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:04.550
Now, there's no need to be so wary.

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:07.910
Dora-tan is Nya-tan's spirit master.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:08.720
Huh?

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:12.630
I thought, if my character was a 
tragic heroine who's shocked because

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:16.070
the dragon Eto-musume she thought was 
a friend ended up being a traitor,

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:18.880
it might touch Takeru's heart.

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.910
Nothing's going to touch me if you 
use such a convoluted method.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:24.430
Of course not.

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:28.930
That's why I played the enemy role 
and fired a little attack at you.

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:32.520
I never intended to hit you.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:35.350
Actually, that came pretty close...

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:37.840
Wh-What?

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:40.810
Did you wash yourself with shampoo?

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:41.280
Huh?

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:45.590
I might have refilled the soap 
bottle with shampoo by mistake.

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:46.450
Tee-hee!

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.130
Grr...

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.310
Grrr

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:52.040
But, Dora-tan, what did you 
mean by "first-rate Sol/Lull"?

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.290
Oh, yes. It's extremely rare Sol/Lull.

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:58.700
It's of the finest quality to us 
in both quality and quantity.

00:19:58.700 --> 00:19:59.800
Really?

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:00.800
Yes.

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:04.550
You should have felt it when you used 
your Sol/Lull Charge in that battle.

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:10.520
Even that small amount gave 
you enough power to fight me.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.720
I see, I see!

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.430
You don't get it at all, do you?

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:19.400
Nya-tan falls a little short 
in the brains department.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:20.520
I see...

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:22.280
In other words...

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:24.320
I got an invincibility star?!

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:23.300
<b>Right On!</b>

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:29.350
Yes. That's exactly what it means.

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:31.310
With Takeru, I'm invincible!

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:33.250
Good for you, Nya-tan.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:36.040
Though that's only if you can 
get Sol/Lull from him...

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:40.270
That's easy! I just have 
to poke him a little!

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.320
Poking doesn't make Sol/Lull come out.

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:44.000
It's like a cosplay skit...

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:47.010
Then I'll just play the little 
sister or present character again!

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:48.550
Well, I'm hungry, 
so I guess I'll fix dinner.

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:49.810
I want some!

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.820
I don't like hot foods, 
so keep it room temperature.

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:55.430
I'll have anything but pork.

00:20:52.820 --> 00:21:02.820
Meat! Meat! Meat! Eat! Meat! Fish!

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:57.790
Where do I even start pointing 
out what's wrong here?

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:01.230
Oh, well. I'm tired.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.570
I won't think too much about it...

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:05.070
<b>Oh, Right</b>

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:10.910
My house was completely destroyed!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.400
What do I do about this?!

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:14.010
You're denser than I thought.

00:21:14.010 --> 00:21:16.410
Don't worry, Takeru! 
I'll strip down and help!

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:20.370
You mean buckle down and help! 
That didn't even make sense!

00:22:59.910 --> 00:23:03.680
All because... All because my 
name doesn't sound nice...

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:10.740
<b>Oden</b>

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:04.490
Now, now...

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:06.600
Don't worry about it.

00:23:07.290 --> 00:23:08.840
What a pain.

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:09.800
My...

00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:10.740
Delicious.

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:13.240
My...

00:23:13.930 --> 00:23:16.740
You all seem to be in high spirits.

00:23:19.010 --> 00:23:20.550
Where've you been?

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:24.000
You're in pretty high spirits yourself.

00:23:24.860 --> 00:23:27.260
I met a rather interesting human.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:48.110
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:37.890
Here's the fortune for those 
born in the year of the cat!

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:40.730
If you were born in the year of 
the cat, you have to worship me!

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:41.490
Year of the cat?

00:23:41.490 --> 00:23:44.760
People born in the year of the cat are a 
miracle seen once every million years!

00:23:44.760 --> 00:23:46.940
So none exist in the human race yet.

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:48.110
Meow?!

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>A Strange and Loving Ox Relationship</b>

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:50.030
Next time: A Strange and 
Loving Ox Relationship.

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.750
<b>Will the king show up again next week?! 
Watch and see!!</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.750
<b>Illustration: Shimono Hiro</b>
